        "content": "The cause is likely because we have two bots and so we have two `BOT_USER_ID`s to compare. Perhaps it makes sense to add both bot ids and check the actor.id against both?\r\nThat is just an assumption obviously but to answer the question: TypeBox verifies that the env vars are defined. Whether they reflect our actual bot is another question, we opt'd for the ID over the username a while back although if there is no other clean solution it'll have to do.",
